# ── the two rendered documents, produced once for the prose pins below ──────
# A.2c moved the manifest and the injected context into the core, but what they
# SAY stays a product invariant of ae: an agent that is never told rule 5 or
# rule 9 does not follow them, wherever the sentence is generated. So the prose
# assertions further down grep the REAL renders instead of the bash heredocs they
